{"v":4,"catch":"振作起來，永不放棄！","desc":"這是一款混亂刺激的攀爬遊戲，你唯一的敵人就是重力…以及你自己的自信。\n\n在各種隨機物體、奇形怪狀的平台和搖搖欲墜的建築上跳躍，努力攀登到頂峰。聽起來很簡單？一次失誤——你就得摔下來。\n\n這可不是一段平靜的旅程。\n\n這是一場喧鬧刺激、令人上癮的攀爬，充滿了失敗、歡笑和意想不到的瞬間。\n\n毫不留情。\n\n只有 Tung Tung。","publisher":"Play Lab","release":"2026-03-12","genres":["街機","冒險","模擬","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4376c0817acc910f06b14515d163122faf0afba4d0143f081b167958e189fd14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac9c64f5e48e528f94311e803e509290f4f46683677162c11ee215ec7a637767.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/febf742c42300940b8a6f1f15e64817a3e220ab894c554e77378c70dda83fbc2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/38bccd5121db9458acdb9e64597d90666a2993ba841602cdfe0b6058cd16e18c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10b2ac2dc6340134ab9e101e480a391a5641382d4c83a0814af40b059ebd03ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b76da48aa41fb327de346eb87bb10daee9aafaa6c1cdce464d5882b48cbcf65.jpg"],"titleId":"0100403026c16000","dlc":[]}